            "body": "edit does reach buffer, but it never enters redo https://github.com/neovim/neovim/blob/28d641b5607025c34153e11272fbd270ac673f85/src/nvim/insert.c#L949-L952\n\nother cursors show it only as a live  preview. at `<Esc>` commit deletes those previews\nhttps://github.com/neovim/neovim/blob/28d641b5607025c34153e11272fbd270ac673f85/src/nvim/mcursor.c#L930\n\nand replay can't reproduce edit\nhttps://github.com/neovim/neovim/blob/28d641b5607025c34153e11272fbd270ac673f85/src/nvim/mcursor.c#L1167\n\nworking on fix",
